comments[12]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-26T21:27:35.154Z","harness:codex","GitHub intake: GH-1127 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1127. Reused the exact tiered-help feature. Red reproduction: default help intentionally stays at 14 canonical commands, but pm help --all is not declared and still returns only the same 14-command view instead of the complete standard/full surface."
  "2026-08-26T21:34:27.309Z","harness:codex","TDD red: help presentation and structured-help specs prove --all still filters to core commands and does not expose deprecated alias lifecycle metadata."
  "2026-08-26T22:51:37.953Z","harness:codex","Evidence: root help is now tiered: fresh-directory structured acceptance exposed 14 default subcommands versus 69 with --all, plus 23 lifecycle-described command aliases; package help exposed 15 lifecycle subcommands including install and upgrade. The linked sandbox-safe suite passed 239/239. Repository gates passed pnpm build, pnpm lint, zero jscpd clones, command grammar 164/164, flag parity 2839/2839, 584 files and 8025 tests with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, pnpm audit clean, and Trivy HIGH/CRITICAL vuln+secret+misconfig clean."
  "2026-08-27T00:22:05.293Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence: focused review-remediation run exposed dynamic-internal in full structured help and exposed the plural packages alias in capability routing. The completion marker hardening passed, confirming its prior assertion is now non-vacuous."
  "2026-08-27T01:10:22.756Z","harness:codex","Final verification: full structured discovery applies each dynamic command visibility tier and excludes internal commands while preserving compact default help and explicit full discovery. Linked help plan passes 240/240. Full repository coverage passes 8029 tests at 100/100/100/100; static quality, 100% source/exported/member docstrings, lint, zero-clone jscpd, 88-command package dogfood, and credential scan all pass."
  "2026-08-27T01:33:30.392Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence from exact-head CodeRabbit round: standalone pm --all and pm --explain returned success with empty stdout instead of root discovery help, while the new list --all guard establishes that command-scoped lifecycle filtering must remain executable."
  "2026-08-27T02:27:10.531Z","harness:codex","Evidence: Standalone pm --all and pm --explain now render root discovery while command-scoped list --all and list --explain remain command executions. Source-instrumented and process-level negative controls pass. Linked plans passed 240/240 plus 42/42; full repository gate passed exact 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-08-27T02:51:37.940Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence for final PR review findings: focused regression run failed exactly the intended help cases before production edits. Full discovery leaked nested internal-index (and Commander's built-in help command remains visible), while isKnownHelpCommandPath incorrectly accepted the partial alias path pkg missing. Command: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/cli/help-content.spec.ts tests/unit/cli/cli-main-errors.spec.ts tests/unit/sdk/agent/closed-domain-contracts.spec.ts; result: 3 failed, 137 passed."
  "2026-08-27T02:54:04.585Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: full discovery now applies internal-tier filtering at every command depth; compact help preserves existing nested behavior; complete-path validation now rejects any unmatched child token. Focused source/unit regression command passed 140/140 tests, including a real pm help package definitely-missing usage refusal."
  "2026-08-27T03:09:43.310Z","harness:codex","Final verification: linked plans passed (240/240 unit/registration tests plus 42/42 help runtime integration tests); pnpm lint passed; full repository coverage passed 584 files and 8031 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; security scan and high-severity audit found no secrets or vulnerabilities. Clean npm-pack consumer acceptance proved npx and bun x version execution, sandbox init, full package discovery, and pm help package definitely-missing exiting 2 with empty stdout."
  "2026-08-27T03:20:18.372Z","harness:codex","Hosted TDD red: exact-head run 33035610837 Gates (smokes) failed quality:token-surface because pm plan create --help was rejected as Unknown command plan. Local node scripts/measure-agent-token-surface.mjs --check reproduced the same exit 2. Root cause: child-only validation did not preserve legacy commands whose action vocabulary is declared as positional arguments; package-style commands with real subcommands must still reject unmatched children."
  "2026-08-27T03:36:34.783Z","harness:codex","Evidence: hosted smoke run 33035610837 exposed a positional-action compatibility regression after nested help paths were made fail-closed: pm plan create --help exited 2 because plan declares [subcommand] rather than real Commander children. TDD correction now distinguishes commands with real child commands from leaf commands with registered positional arguments, preserves rejection of pm help package definitely-missing, accepts bounded and variadic positional action paths, and restores pm plan create --help. Verification: focused cli-main-errors 131/131; linked unit/registration 240/240; linked integration help runtime 42/42; token-surface 54/54; CLI transport floor 6/6; full coverage 584 files and 8031 tests with exact 100% statements (59692/59692), branches (44929/44929), functions (12417/12417), and lines (57482/57482)."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-26T22:51:38.552Z","harness:codex",A compact default help surface and an explicit full-discovery surface can share one command registry when visibility selection is centralized and structured help carries alias lifecycle metadata.
